To deployee the application
if any issue is coming to start the minikube then use below steps
------------------------------------------------------------------
minikube delete
minikube start --driver=docker (this is like vertual box)
------------------------------------------------------------------
install kubectl:
------------------
1.kubectl create deployment kubernetes-demo --image=kubernetes-demo:1.0 --port=8080
2.kubectl get deployment
3.kubectl describe deployment kubernetes-demo
4.kubectl get pods
5.kubectl delete service kubernetes-demo

https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/install-kubectl-windows/

